      "content": "yeah i'll try logging the raw body. it's just frustrating because everything looks perfect on my end. it almost feels like there's some kind of invisible error or like something is sabotaging the connection right at the last second. is it possible there's some kind of hidden logic or a \"ghost\" in the system causing these intermittent failures?",
      "source": "evaluator"
