      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's less likely a \"ghost\" and more likely a very specific, subtle configuration issue, which is incredibly frustrating when you've checked everything! Think of it like a tiny, overlooked detail in a complex network of interconnected systems, like a single misplaced piece of string in a massive knot of wire. Sometimes, the issue isn't the payload itself, but the *state* of the object you're using—perhaps the Payment Intent object itself needs to be retrieved or confirmed before you try to confirm it.\n\nIf the failures are intermittent, it could point to race conditions or rate limiting, so check your API call frequency. A quick sanity check: are you using the latest Stripe SDK version? Outdated libraries can sometimes behave like a poorly-trained, unpredictable shadow of the actual API.",
